367	 *   omitted, empty, or nullish prefix falls back to the default `instui` (`<instui-icon>`). `only` limits
368	 *   registration to a subset of the `ELEMENTS` base names — its nested render dependencies are pulled in
369	 *   automatically, so `{ only: ["date-time-input"] }` also defines `date-input` and `calendar`. Omit
370	 *   `only` to register every element (the default).
371	 *
372	 * @example
373	 * ```ts
374	 * import { register } from "@pantoken/web-components";
375	 * import "@pantoken/css"; // defines the --instui-* custom properties the elements read
376	 *
377	 * register(); // <instui-button>, <instui-icon>, …
378	 * register(customElements, { prefix: "x" }); // <x-button>, <x-icon>, …
379	 * register(customElements, { only: ["button", "alert"] }); // just those two
380	 * register(customElements, { locale: "hu", strings: { back: "Vissza" } }); // localized
381	 * ```
