13	 *   dependency chain pulls in) still bundle `@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens`, since they call
14	 *   `iconSvg` for real — see `buildRegisterContext`'s doc comment in `src/index.ts` for why that can't
15	 *   be avoided for those five specifically. Multi-element consumers combine several of these files
16	 *   (e.g. via jsDelivr's `/combine/`) rather than getting one bundle with everything they asked for;
17	 *   nested-dependency elements (`date-input`, `date-time-input`) aren't self-contained here — a
