21	/* Each CSS-API `@example` is a source fence that seams into a bordered, page-background frame
22	   (`.css-example`) below it — the fence loses its bottom rounding + margin so the two read as one unit
23	   (square BOTH the outer wrapper and the inner <pre>, which paints the dark bg + carries its own radius,
24	   so no rounded corner peeks through the seam). Inside the frame, the live example sits in the same
25	   elevated `.instui-card` the /demos use (from `@pantoken/demo/card.css`, bundled by the theme). */
26	div[class*="language-"]:has(+ .css-example) {
27	  margin-bottom: 0;
28	}
