61	/* Image-valued tokens (icons, logos, mask helpers) carry a `data:image` URI; the plugin decodes it to
62	   inline SVG here. The box carries `color: var(--vp-c-text-1)` so `currentColor` icons resolve to the
63	   theme text colour and stay visible in light and dark; the SVG is capped so wide logos don't overflow
